<translate>
==== WorldRender ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is false, then the item will not appear on the ground as a 3D item.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
WorldRender = false,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

